<title>USA: Tenneco Inc to sell $300 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Tenneco Inc to sell $300 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenneco Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond market on Wednesday for $300 million in 20-year debentures, according to market sources.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to be rated Baa1/BBB with price talk of +76 to +78 basis points, with a make-whole call feature at +20 basis points.</p>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston is will serve as the lead manager for the deal, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Tenneco Inc is involved in the packaging and automotive parts business.</p>
<p>(( -- Caryn Trokie, 212-8159-1678 ))</p>
